## Helper for liberal-01.hak - liberal, and contributes one bare word.
##
## The includer opens an array literal, this file supplies the single item, and
## the includer closes it. Compilation of a form is deferred until the form
## closes, so by then hak->c->curinp has already swung back to the includer.
## The word must still be read in THIS file's mode.
##
## [NOTE] a fixture, not a test - see liberal-inc.hak.

$pragma liberal on
abc
